Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(prototype): PERM-3, SALE-2, SALE-3, SALE-6, SHIFT-2,
 RESET-2 with regression tests

Legacy prototypes/nilesys only (no engine, API, auth, tenancy or migration file touched).
- PERM-3: POS data routes require user.system === 'pos' (403 otherwise)
- SALE-2: stock sufficiency checked (aggregated per product) before deduction -> 409
- SALE-3: cash paid must cover total -> 400; card recorded at exact total
- SALE-6: unique barcode among active products -> 409
- SHIFT-2: refunds recorded per return (time/amount/method, discount pro rata);
  expected cash = start + cash sales - cash refunds in the shift window;
  shift screen uses server-computed expectedCashNow
- RESET-2: deterministic demo user ids so sessions survive a reset
- SEED-1 (found while testing SHIFT-2): no future-dated seeded sales
- DB_FILE env var so tests run against a throwaway data file
tests/regression.test.js: 16 self-contained node:test cases (13/15 original cases fail on the old server).
tests/review.test.js v3: characterization (INFO) asserts now assert the fixed behaviour; stale RET-4 assert corrected.
